config BR2_PACKAGE_ROMBOOT_JOYPAD_AUTOCONFIG
	bool "RetroArch joypad autoconfig profiles (udev)"
	help
	  Bundles RetroArch's joypad autoconfiguration profiles so USB
	  controllers are mapped automatically by vendor/product id, without
	  a per-device binding in retroarch.cfg.

	  https://github.com/libretro/retroarch-joypad-autoconfig
